{"v":15,"id":"a05","kid":"alex","title":"A Rainy Day","zh":"下雨天","level":"2","genre":"天气","src":"original","sum":"星期六下雨不能去公园，小作者很难过。爸爸想了个好主意：穿上雨衣雨靴去踩水坑！下雨天也可以很好玩。","words":93,"paras":[{"t":"Today is Saturday. I want to go to the park, but it is raining. The sky is gray. I can hear the rain on the window: pitter-patter, pitter-patter.","w":[[0,5,"today",-1],[6,8,"is",-1],[9,17,"saturday",-1],[19,20,"i",-1],[21,25,"want",-1],[26,28,"to",-1],[29,31,"go",-1],[32,34,"to",-1],[35,38,"the",-1],[39,43,"park",-1],[45,48,"but",-1],[49,51,"it",-1],[52,54,"is",-1],[55,62,"raining",-1],[64,67,"the",-1],[68,71,"sky",-1],[72,74,"is",-1],[75,79,"gray",-1],[81,82,"i",-1],[83,86,"can",-1],[87,91,"hear",-1],[92,95,"the",-1],[96,100,"rain",-1],[101,103,"on",-1],[104,107,"the",-1],[108,114,"window",-1],[116,129,"pitter-patter",-1],[131,144,"pitter-patter",-1]]},{"t":"I am sad. Then Dad has an idea. \"Let's put on our raincoats and boots!\" he says.","w":[[0,1,"i",-1],[2,4,"am",-1],[5,8,"sad",-1],[10,14,"then",-1],[15,18,"Dad",-1],[19,22,"has",1],[23,25,"an",1],[26,30,"idea",1],[33,38,"let's",-1],[39,42,"put",0],[43,45,"on",0],[46,49,"our",-1],[50,59,"raincoats",-1],[60,63,"and",-1],[64,69,"boots",-1],[72,74,"he",-1],[75,79,"says",-1]]},{"t":"We go outside. I jump in the puddles. Splash! Dad jumps, too. We laugh and laugh. We see a little frog. It is happy in the rain, too.","w":[[0,2,"we",-1],[3,5,"go",-1],[6,13,"outside",-1],[15,16,"i",-1],[17,21,"jump",-1],[22,24,"in",-1],[25,28,"the",-1],[29,36,"puddles",-1],[38,44,"splash",-1],[46,49,"Dad",-1],[50,55,"jumps",-1],[57,60,"too",-1],[62,64,"we",-1],[65,70,"laugh",-1],[71,74,"and",-1],[75,80,"laugh",-1],[82,84,"we",-1],[85,88,"see",-1],[89,90,"a",-1],[91,97,"little",-1],[98,102,"frog",-1],[104,106,"it",-1],[107,109,"is",-1],[110,115,"happy",-1],[116,118,"in",-1],[119,122,"the",-1],[123,127,"rain",-1],[129,132,"too",-1]]},{"t":"When we get home, we are wet. Mom gives us hot chocolate. A rainy day can be a fun day!","w":[[0,4,"when",-1],[5